    <p className="info-strip">Only column names, order, the default column, and advisory limits are copied. Source cards, hidden columns, milestone columns, and automation are not copied. Tasks already tagged directly with this project appear in its imported default column. Its own milestones keep their separate columns. The copied columns have no ongoing policy or configuration link to the source.</p>
    {shownPreview && <section className="workboard-import-preview" role="region" aria-label="Column import preview"><h3>Columns from {projectDisplayName(shownPreview.sourceProject)}</h3><p>Target board version {shownPreview.expectedBoardVersion} · Source board version {shownPreview.expectedSourceBoardVersion}</p><ol className="workboard-import-columns">{shownPreview.columns.map(column => <li key={column.id}><strong>{column.name}</strong><span>{column.isDefault ? 'Default column' : 'Normal column'} · {column.pointLimit === null ? 'No advisory card limit' : `Advisory card limit: ${column.pointLimit}`}</span></li>)}</ol><p>This displayed order and configuration are pinned until you explicitly load a new preview.</p></section>}
